      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-assoma/ja/news/awards/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;業界の認識と製品の優秀性を祝して 
    &lt;div id=&#34;業界の認識と製品の優秀性を祝して&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#%e6%a5%ad%e7%95%8c%e3%81%ae%e8%aa%8d%e8%ad%98%e3%81%a8%e8%a3%bd%e5%93%81%e3%81%ae%e5%84%aa%e7%a7%80%e6%80%a7%e3%82%92%e7%a5%9d%e3%81%97%e3%81%a6&#34; aria-label=&#34;アンカー&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
